@startuml 04-document-status-polling
title GET /api/documents/{id}/status - polling z UI po uploadzie

actor "Admin UI\n(useDocuments)" as UI
participant "DocumentController" as Ctrl
participant "GetDocumentStatusUseCase\n(DocumentService)" as DS
participant "DocumentRepository" as DR
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

note over UI #LightBlue: Po POST /api/documents\nfront pollije co 2 sek\nrefetchInterval w useDocuments\n(auto-stop gdy wszystko READY)

loop dopóki status == PENDING || PROCESSING

  UI -> Ctrl: GET /api/documents/{id}/status
  activate Ctrl

  Ctrl -> DS: getStatus(DocumentId)
  activate DS
  DS -> DR: findById(id)
  DR -> DB: SELECT * FROM documents\nWHERE id = ? AND tenant_id = ?
  alt nie znaleziono
    DR --> DS: Optional.empty()
    DS --> Ctrl: throw DocumentNotFoundException
    Ctrl --> UI: 404 + ProblemDetail
  else znaleziono
    DR --> DS: Document
    DS --> Ctrl: Document
    deactivate DS

    Ctrl --> UI: 200 OK + JSON\n{ id, filename, status, indexedAt?, errorMessage? }
    deactivate Ctrl
  end

  note over UI: status możliwe:\n PENDING (właśnie wgrane)\n PROCESSING (Tika/embed)\n READY (chunki w bazie)\n FAILED (error w pipeline)

end

note over UI #LightBlue: Gdy wszystkie dokumenty\nw cache są READY/FAILED,\nTanStack Query zatrzymuje\nrefetchInterval automatycznie

@enduml
